                "Id": "e27c55eb-e61d-4b15-bb4c-b52874603132",
                "Slides": [
                    {
                        "Content": "AMAZING GRACE! HOW SWEET THE SOUND\nTHAT SAVED A WRETCH LIKE ME!\nI ONCE WAS LOST, BUT NOW AM FOUND;\nWAS BLIND, BUT NOW I SEE.",
                        "CustomBackgroundPath": null,
                        "FontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                        "FontFamily": "Tahoma",
                        "FontSize": 13,
                        "HasOutline": true,
                        "HasShadow": true,
                        "Id": "3c600c72-3ba8-4ae7-a91c-e26ed3b1026f",
                        "IsBold": true,
                        "IsItalic": false,
                        "IsUnderline": false,
                        "Label": "Verse 1",
                        "Subtitle": "",
                        "Title": "Amazing Grace",
                        "Type": 1
                    },
                    {
                        "Content": "'TWAS GRACE THAT TAUGHT MY HEART TO FEAR,\nAND GRACE MY FEARS RELIEVED;\nHOW PRECIOUS DID THAT GRACE APPEAR\nTHE HOUR I FIRST BELIEVED.",
                        "CustomBackgroundPath": null,
                        "FontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                        "FontFamily": "Tahoma",
                        "FontSize": 13,
                        "HasOutline": true,
                        "HasShadow": true,
                        "Id": "55c5c0f5-4ca0-4a98-a0b8-4096ce7ff10e",
                        "IsBold": true,
                        "IsItalic": false,
                        "IsUnderline": false,
                        "Label": "Verse 2",
                        "Subtitle": "",
                        "Title": "Amazing Grace",
                        "Type": 1
                    },
                    {
                        "Content": "THROUGH MANY DANGERS, TOILS AND SNARES,\nI HAVE ALREADY COME;\n'TIS GRACE HATH BROUGHT ME SAFE THUS FAR,\nAND GRACE WILL LEAD ME HOME.",
                        "CustomBackgroundPath": null,
                        "FontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                        "FontFamily": "Tahoma",
                        "FontSize": 13,
                        "HasOutline": true,
                        "HasShadow": true,
                        "Id": "e43bf0d1-51c6-4b09-98c9-ce96a8868375",
                        "IsBold": true,
                        "IsItalic": false,
                        "IsUnderline": false,
                        "Label": "Verse 3",
                        "Subtitle": "",
                        "Title": "Amazing Grace",
                        "Type": 1
                    },
                    {
                        "Content": "WHEN WE'VE BEEN THERE TEN THOUSAND YEARS,\nBRIGHT SHINING AS THE SUN,\nWE'VE NO LESS DAYS TO SING GOD'S PRAISE\nTHAN WHEN WE'D FIRST BEGUN.",
                        "CustomBackgroundPath": null,
                        "FontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                        "FontFamily": "Tahoma",
                        "FontSize": 13,
                        "HasOutline": true,
                        "HasShadow": true,
                        "Id": "0408efa0-1809-4d34-a385-b9cbe495cf42",
                        "IsBold": true,
                        "IsItalic": false,
                        "IsUnderline": false,
                        "Label": "Verse 4",
                        "Subtitle": "",
                        "Title": "Amazing Grace",
                        "Type": 1
                    }
                ],
                "Subtitle": "By John Newton",
                "Title": "Amazing Grace"
            },
            "Title": "Amazing Grace",
            "TypeLabel": "Song"
        }
    ],
